---
// Screenshots side by side, wrapping onto new lines when the column is narrow.
---

<div class="screenshot-row"><slot /></div>

<style is:global>
  .sl-markdown-content .screenshot-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  /* Starlight spaces consecutive elements with a top margin; the gap does that here. */
  .sl-markdown-content .screenshot-row > * {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
</style>
